# Keep the gateway Docker build context small. The build stage fetches the Linux `tish` binary fresh via
# `npm install @tishlang/tish`, so the host's macOS/arm64 node_modules must never leak into the image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
build
target
**/target
.git
.cursor
.claude
*.log
*.sqlite
.env
.DS_Store
